# Issue resolution log

When a queue bug/warning/operational issue is diagnosed or resolved, prepend an entry to `Production Design Queue Manager/.cursor/issue-log.md`.

```markdown
### YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM TZ
**Issue:** One sentence.
**Resolution:** Concrete fix or conclusion.
```

Do not log pure how-tos. Write the log yourself in the same turn.
